{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16991","headline":"奉酬中书相公至日圜丘行事合於中书宿斋移止於集贤院叙情见寄之什 · 武元衡","name":"奉酬中书相公至日圜丘行事合於中书宿斋移止於集贤院叙情见寄之什","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"郊庙祗严祀，斋庄觌上玄。\n别开金虎观，不离紫微天。\n树古长杨接，池清太液连。\n仲山方补衮，文举自伤年。\n风溢铜壶漏，香凝绮阁烟。\n仍闻白雪唱，流咏满鵾弦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16991.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16991","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}